<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,528 bln bfr in Dec.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,528 bln bfr in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Dec   change in mth  change in 1996</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,998.8    +22.4	     +293.5</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   658.6     -9.6	     -140.2</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,790.3    -74.7	     +132.9</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies    75.4   -128.6	     -210.0</p>
<p>    net debt		 9,528.5   -235.8		 +7.7</p>
<p>    net borrowing requirement	 -98.9	     +242.8</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
